rule weighed_order v1
description "Whether an order is large and whether it is heavy. An order weighs 20 kg or more, and a line 50 kg at most: a line or two of little weight reach the bottom only with heavier lines beside them"

# A line of the order
elements lines
  price  : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=100JPY
  weight : mass[kg]  range >=1kg <=50kg

sum total over lines of price  range >=0JPY <=1_000JPY
sum load over lines of weight  range >=20kg <=200kg

outputs
  large : bool
  heavy : bool

table large_of
policy unique
| total    | -> large |
| <150JPY  | false    |
| >=150JPY | true     |

table heavy_of
policy unique
| load    | -> heavy |
| <100kg  | false    |
| >=100kg | true     |
